"https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391859_1518112312188611_1355305485291339783_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7Hk1f6ZHfmsQ7kNvwFl11ls&_nc_oc=AdqG1KsmACVyqHJEJUOsehYPKszGs3gf7mp5UQQZ0w5LV9COfIQJrzq4OmGfPfukpRw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK8_1qhS3XL-TJhq8k5gEb69UPg8ZlevxShbqubcrN39A&oe=6AAEA1C4"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00040.png", "id": "628702753183188", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393195_628702759849854_3453678486927347405_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OIbbDVXJdz4Q7kNvwEC_ttj&_nc_oc=AdopdsAS-oaAH1zzqkQkXBYKXJNI0jX-z6-Q2VLxlv59N8grmVAWU4DAQQW0HYDe4P0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLnkhINbe_Gtn5pXoKbm2n32nLp78tF9A6aoLybzEEzLQ&oe=6AAE8188"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00041.png", "id": "1127727558894208", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393558_1127727562227541_6305939956224130709_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AyaEZ1HDebkQ7kNvwFjcmA_&_nc_oc=AdpfQCwlVcdAgF-RfckQNPdI1rlYc9pHt8mL5ne13EKT0YGdY1_waKfRNd58lail3xE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKJ8KrSZSL0z6O56Ug2uc7iwWF1twKr0yDaSbF3EzNHxw&oe=6AAE8613"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00039.png", "id": "1139738020612460", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391739_1139738023945793_5280059691858437436_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wcEdHk2f6UkQ7kNvwFQkwyU&_nc_oc=AdrEgLmps4GAaYoDcKu9ulMN7gCJ_9tGJtr4zwwXGUCcc4O5UgfzL8F7D2VqeWOAhJw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQICjvfFZgNFMVpYJzRTl_iUoNae3L-XC9WedC4jJZjjMg&oe=6AAE912B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled (15).png", "id": "646952687853124", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393453_646952694519790_7054400811726926357_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=edlu8J4ADvkQ7kNvwEnFBZU&_nc_oc=AdpxufVaxAYE2EhW9_T0eG3Zw_KCEhMwqoJ5CiVyJfP1IAHp9a0gdt25J06XRLV-MQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIUZj7llIj6-R0MzW8UZYtvAti8QJZJlvkgl7NeqTLhsg&oe=6AAE9EAC"}, "display_name": "MetaBlogger", "keywords": ["videoplatform", "blog", "blogger", "interactive"], "long_description": "Every day, millions of people watch online videos, but the experience is completely one-sided. You sit back, watch, and if you have a question, you can only hope for an answer buried in a sea of comments. The creators you follow dictate the pace, the topics, and the flow\u2014there\u2019s no way to engage in real-time.\n\nOn top of that, traditional content consumption is limited to flat, 2D screens. No matter how immersive the storytelling, you\u2019re still just an observer, not a participant.\n\nMetaBlogger VR revolutionizes content consumption by making it interactive, responsive, and fully immersive. Instead of passively watching a video, you step inside a VR-powered world where AI-driven metabloggers replace traditional human creators. These AI hosts are not just digital avatars\u2014they respond instantly to your questions, adapt to your interests, and engage with you in a way that no pre-recorded video ever could.", "short_description": "MetaBlogger lets you engage with AI-powered metabloggers in real time. Interrupt, ask questions, and get instant responses as you explore a new era of interactive media. \nKey Features:\n- AI-driven metabloggers instead of human creators\n - Real-time interaction\u2014ask questions anytime"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.alindor.tech/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Alindor", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.alindor.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_to